WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.160
Count by 2s: 12, 14, 16, blank . What comes next? Let us think carefully. Add 2 each

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.477
time. The answer is 18. Great work!

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:15.781
Count by 5s: 35, 40, 45, blank . What is missing? Let us think carefully. Add 5 each

00:00:15.781 --> 00:00:18.307
time. The answer is 50. Great work!

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:26.950
Count by 10s: 120, 130, 140, blank . What comes next? Let us think carefully. Add 10

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:30.637
each time. The answer is 150. Great work!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:37.748
Count by 2s: 44, 46, 48, blank . What is missing? Let us think carefully. Add 2 each

00:00:37.748 --> 00:00:40.197
time. The answer is 50. Great work!
